# Scenario 'mail_server': メールサーバ (server mail management): notices, "かくにんしてからけす", connect to the (fake) POP3 server
# (dial #9677, PPP, DNS pop.<sub-domain>.dion.ne.jp, POP3 USER/PASS/STAT/QUIT), result screens
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (adapter registered, nickname set), fake Internet on.
# Every section shows a first-use tutorial the first time it is entered; SELECT ("おわる") skips it.
# All screen names are from reading the Japanese screens (screenshots), not from the code.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title "スタート"
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # top menu: メール / ホームページ / ヘルプ (メール is preselected)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # enter メール (mail menu, first-use tutorial page)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap SELECT                   # skip tutorial
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
tap DOWN x5
wait 30
tap A                        # enter the item
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_1
tap SELECT                   # skip its tutorial
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_3
tap A                        # first button "かくにんしてからけす" (check, then delete)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_4
tap A                        # "はい"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_5
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mailserver_6
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot mailserver_7
waitstable 60 max 900
shot mailserver_8
wait 400
shot mailserver_9
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot mailserver_10
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot mailserver_11
